Ghidra ELF string- and symbol-table Rust port

This component adapts ElfStringTable, ElfSymbolTable, ElfSymbol,
ElfHeader.parseStringTables, ElfHeader.parseSymbolTables and the unbounded-reader
recovery behavior from
Ghidra commit
9a723ce99952771b8368329503aa589ae233e916. The original Ghidra checkout and the
prior Rust components remain unchanged. This is not an official release.

